    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "He recalls an event with medics/brother/cigarette that he says 'really didn't happen' but felt real. He reports a controllable 'movie' of the life he wanted (including marrying a girl he liked, which later occurred). Return sensation described as repeated 'ton of bricks' impacts to the chest.",
